5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,200
Anyway, it’s the same as in the movie

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,700
Heavy snow covers the whole city

7
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,200
You can't meet anyone on the road at all

8
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,890
Mo's night

9
