I'm tracking a criminal on a case

10
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,590
This person hid in the mall and I followed him in.

11
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:19,390
The criminal saw me and ran out of the mall

12
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:20,390
