I almost rushed out of the mall

16
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,190
Saved a small life

17
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,190
Mr. Lin

18
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,890
Reason for requisitioning your vehicle

19
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,990
I hope we can save more people

20
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:33,090
