30
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:51,570
Say it again

31
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,470
Even if I lend you my car

32
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,800
You rescue them all and bring them to the mall

33
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,140
